        "end": 18.852
      },
      {
        "kind": "phrase",
        "text": "Let's take a step back.",
        "korean": "한 걸음 물러나서 생각해 봅시다.",
        "start": 19.252,
        "end": 21.4165
      },
      {
        "kind": "phrase",
        "text": "I see your point, but we may need more time.",
